  dialogue:
    NPCName: 
    sentences:
    - What do you want?
    - Have you got something for me?
    - /(What did I have again?)8
    - "(What am I thinking! Thats so \nawkward, I can't get that wrong)"
    - "~(I'll say the right thing this time,    \nsurely)"
    - "I've got this letter for you, \nI was asked to deliver it."
    - I wasn't expecting any letter.
    - /(What should I do?)9
    - "(This guy has a short temper, if I just told \nhim to take it he wouldn't
      be happy)"
    - "~(I should think of something different to \nsay)"
    - 'It''s from the reception. '
    - 'I was told to bring it up to you,

      because I snuck into the laundry
      room.'
    - What?
    - Fine then, hand it over already.
    - (This is really hard)
    - (I'm going back to bed...)
    names:
    - Neighbour
    - Neighbour
    - Me
